7-northern-wei-complete:source_review13-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"ouk_0jo_ict","source_quote":"三年，領軍將軍李安民、左軍將軍孫文顯與虜軍戰於淮陽，大敗之。初，虜寇至，緣淮驅略，江北居民猶懲佛狸時事，皆驚走，不可禁止。乃於梁山置二軍，南置三軍，慈姥置一軍，洌州置二軍，三山置二軍，白沙洲置一軍，蔡州置五軍，長蘆置三軍，菰浦置二軍，徐浦置一軍，內外悉班階賞，以示威刑。","reading":"建元三年淮陽勝捷及江北備禦。梁山二軍有殿本一軍對文，小注原樣存。","note":"建元三年淮陽勝捷及江北備禦。梁山二軍有殿本一軍對文，小注原樣存。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p013","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":135,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete-ws1999801"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p013:m0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"李安民","kind":"person","person_id":"ouk_0jo_ict","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p013","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-057-northern-wei-complete:p013","text":"三年，領軍將軍李安民、左軍將軍孫文顯與虜軍戰於淮陽，大敗之。初，虜寇至，緣淮驅略，江北居民猶懲佛狸時事，皆驚走，不可禁止。乃於梁山置二軍，南置三軍，慈姥置一軍，洌州置二軍，三山置二軍，白沙洲置一軍，蔡州置五軍，長蘆置三軍，菰浦置二軍，徐浦置一軍，內外悉班階賞，以示威刑。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":34,"last_line":34,"raw_start":2777,"raw_end":2958,"raw_character_offsets":[2777,2778,2779,2780,2781,2782,2783,2784,2785,2786,2787,2788,2789,2790,2791,2792,2793,2794,2795,2796,2797,2798,2799,2800,2801,2802,2803,2804,2805,2806,2807,2808,2809,2810,2811,2812,2813,2814,2815,2816,2817,2818,2819,2820,2821,2822,2823,2824,2825,2826,2827,2828,2829,2830,2831,2832,2833